 background-color:#3366ff; border-style:solid;border-width:thin;border-color:black;"><div class="s16"><div class="s1"><p class="s14"><span class="s15">Апоптоз</span></p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:417; left:524; width:153; height:56; background-color:#3366ff; border-style:solid;border-width:thin;border-color:black;"><div class="s16"><div class="s1"><p class="s14"><span class="s15">Некроз</span></p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:496; left:388; width:141; height:28;"><div class="s18"><p class="s19"><span class="s15">Гибель клетки</span></p></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:275; left:240; width:141; height:50;"><div class="s18"><p class="s19"><span class="s15">Срыв адаптации</span></p></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:179; left:59; width:141; height:72;"><div class="s18"><p class="s19"><span class="s15">Физиол. или патол. воздействие</span></p></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:196; left:275; width:153; height:50;"><div class="s18"><p class="s19"><span class="s15">Повреждающие факторы</span></p></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:213; left:567; width:153; height:50;"><div class="s18"><p class="s19"><span class="s15">Мягкое, транзиторное</span></p></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://E045FC9E-2292-4642-AF0C-3B8EDAE4FFC6/x-apple-ql-magic/D2A842E5-D261-4F82-AF89-40DB7A8B7A7D.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:164; left:158; width:79; height:108;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://3DD644AB-6CB5-4469-B92A-0DC6E9B273A4/x-apple-ql-magic/868CD481-1D3E-4655-8CDB-6A62BE394A4A.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:164; left:391; width:90; height:108;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://5DB00016-40B2-4FBA-B7A2-145A467CC1EA/x-apple-ql-magic/6050B22D-0CDF-48E8-8FAE-CE74A8F4E79B.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:176; left:493; width:79; height:96;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://D88B3DE4-5DFA-442F-87E7-74492AC4788E/x-apple-ql-magic/C311348F-FD91-484D-B6F8-6BEE00983D7C.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:140; left