</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://04AA636B-0B7B-46E2-A65C-C8D5A87FD56B/x-apple-ql-magic/6392D0BE-5F67-493B-8062-D3C632060B3B.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:-20; width:760; height:579;"><div style="position:absolute; top:21; left:36; width:648; height:90;"><div class="s20"><div class="s1"><p class="s21"><span class="s36">Признаки повреждения клетки</span></p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:105; left:36; width:657; height:413;"><div class="s18"><p class="s240"><span class="s241">•</span><span class="s93">Биохимические</span><span class="s93"> </span></p><p class="s242"><span class="s241">-</span><span class="s93">Признаки </span><span class="s93">клеточной дисфункции – высокий уровень билирубина – повреждение гепатоцитов, </span><span class="s93">…</span></p><p class="s242"><span class="s241">-</span><span class="s93">Признаки </span><span class="s93">гибели клеток – высокий уровень внутриклеточных </span><span class="s93">белков:</span></p><p class="s242"><span class="s93"> &nbsp; &nbsp;* </span><span class="s93">инфаркт миокарда </span><span class="s93">– </span><span class="s93">тропонины</span><span class="s93">, </span><span class="s93">КФ</span><span class="s93">К</span><span class="s93">, АСТ, АЛТ</span></p><p class="s242"><span class="s93"> &nbsp; &nbsp;* </span><span class="s93">гепатит</span><span class="s93"> </span><span class="s93">- </span><span class="s93">A</span><span class="s93">СТ</span><span class="s93">, A</span><span class="s93">ЛТ</span></p><p class="s242"><span class="s93"> &nbsp; </span><span class="s93">* </span><span class="s93">панкреатит</span><span class="s93"> </span><span class="s93">– </span><span class="s93">альфа-амилаза</span></p><p class="s242"> </p><p class="s242"> </p></div></div></div><style type="text/css">
