</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://04AA636B-0B7B-46E2-A65C-C8D5A87FD56B/x-apple-ql-magic/6392D0BE-5F67-493B-8062-D3C632060B3B.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:-20; width:760; height:579;"><div style="position:absolute; top:21; left:36; width:648; height:90;"><div class="s20"><div class="s1"><p class="s21"><span class="s36">Признаки повреждения клетки</span></p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:116; left:36; width:657; height:402;"><div class="s18"><p class="s243"><span class="s241">•</span><span class="s93">Электрические изменения (изменения </span><span class="s93">на ЭКГ </span><span class="s93">– ишемия миокарда</span><span class="s93">),</span></p><p class="s244"><span class="s241">•</span><span class="s93">Оптические </span><span class="s93">методы (т.е. гастроскопия</span><span class="s93">),</span></p><p class="s244"><span class="s241">•</span><span class="s93">Морфология</span><span class="s93">: биопсия, </span><span class="s93">посмертное </span><span class="s93">исследование.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://04AA636B-0B7B-46E2-A65C-C8D5A87FD56B/x-apple-ql-magic/6392D0BE-5F67-493B-8062-D3C632060B3B.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:-20; width:760; height:579;"><div style="position:absolute; top:21; left:36; width:648; height:90;"><div class="s20"><div class="s1"><p class="s21"><span class="s36">Лечение</span></p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:126; left:36; width:648; height:356;"><div class="s18"><p class="s243"><span class="s241">•</span><span class="s93">Устранение этиологического фактора</span></p><p class="s244"><span class="s241">•</span><span class="s93">Восстановление снабжения кислородом и </span><span class="s93">питанием</span></p><p class="s244"><span class="s241">•</span><span class="s93">Поддержка и/или замена функции клетки (</span><span class="s93">“</span><span class="s93">отдых</span><span class="s93">”)</span></p><p class="s244"><span class="s241">•</span><span class="s93">Устранение </span><span class="s93">погибших клеток </span><span class="s93">(иногда)</span></p><p class="s244"> </p></div></div></div></body></html>